n Sands\n</p><p><br>\n- <a href=\"/wiki/Bombasto\" title=\"Bombasto\">Bombasto</a>, neckbeard barbarian, plum prosecco in a dirty mug and pretend it's rotgut\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1863/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29550/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7127/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936657/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.361      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.361      1 -total\n 56.54%   25.082      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.05%   22.204     19 Template:Trim\n 21.35%    9.469      2 Template:Uid\n 16.17%    7.175      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.52%    6.442      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.35%    5.480      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.87%    4.820      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.30%    4.571      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46893-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202117 and revision id 385749. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}